<title>USA: Waste Management Inc Q2 net off.</title>
<headline>Waste Management Inc Q2 net off.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.39		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			180,024		  223,042</p>
<p> Revs		   2,327,309		2,330,994</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 466,276		  496,031</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.75		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net			358,436		  408,220</p>
<p> Revs		   4,525,617		4,475,473</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 475,498		  492,593</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding $0.02/shr charge recorded by OHM Corp, in which Waste Mgmt has a 37-pct equity interest, 1997 Q2 net income from continuing operations was $190 million, or $0.41 per share, versus $218 million, or $0.44 per share, excluding a $0.01 per share gain from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1996 6-mos net includes $0.02 per share gain on discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
